            "answer": "<p>Machine wash cold, tumble dry low or hang dry. Avoid high heat \u2014 the TPU backing lasts longer without it. For food stains, rinse immediately after use and spot-treat with dish soap before washing. Most purees and soft foods come out in a standard cold wash.</p>"
